  <section id="home"> 
    <div class="info"> 
      <h1>The Wow! Momo Story</h1> 
    </div> 

    <div class="box"> 
      <div class="story"> 
        <h2>Vision & Innovation</h2> 
        <p>Wow! Momo is one of India’s fastest-growing quick-service restaurant (QSR) brands, famed for transforming a beloved snack — the momo — into a nationwide culinary phenomenon. Founded in 2008 in Kolkata, India, by college classmates Sagar J. Daryani and Binod K. Homagai, the brand began with a modest kiosk and a bold vision: to create an unforgettable food experience that leaves every customer saying “Wow!”</p> 
        <p>From humble beginnings with a 6’×6’ kiosk and an initial ₹30,000 investment, Wow! Momo’s approach combined passion, quality, and creativity. By offering a wide variety of momos — including steamed, fried, pan-fried, and uniquely reinvented formats such as MoBurgs (momo burgers) and momo-based desserts — the brand redefined how India enjoys this popular dumpling.</p> 
      </div> 

      <div class="content"> 
        <h2>Growth & Expansion</h2> 
        <p>Today the company has expanded far beyond its first outlet. The brand now operates hundreds of outlets across dozens of cities in India, with a network continuing to grow aggressively through both company-operated stores and strategic expansion plans. Industry reports note that Wow! Momo crossed 850+ stores in over 95 cities during the financial year 2025-26 — adding about 200 new outlets in that year alone.</p> 
        <p>Wow! Momo has also diversified into multiple related brands, including Wow! China, Wow! Chicken, and Wow! Kulfi, broadening its footprint in the fast-casual dining segment while introducing localized Indian- and Asian-inspired menu innovations.</p> 
      </div> 
    </div> 
